1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:05,550
Every customer leaves a trail of data.
Most of it goes unread.

2
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:11,280
Many of your customers already have plans:
a move, an energy renovation, a new home.

3
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:17,590
Seekridge reads your CRM and relevant
client data, alongside live market data.

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,170
This customer is planning a move.

5
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:25,610
It's your moment to reach out
with a mortgage offer, right on time.

6
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:30,930
This one is planning an energy renovation.
Time to offer a green loan.

7
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:36,970
And this customer just bought a home:
the moment for a home insurance offer.

8
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:42,590
Every Monday, the week's moments
arrive ranked, in your CRM.

9
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:48,390
Seekridge. Opportunities
you can act on, and explain.

